events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T13:44:00Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T13:44:00Z","body":"Yes, somewhere along the chain, the spatial material ends up doing a round trip to and from linear encoding, while the canvas item stays in sRGB encoding the whole way through. (I presume from what you’re saying that this shift doesn’t happen with the Mobile or Forward+ renderers.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4412660877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4839039392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103141#issuecomment-4839039392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103141","id":4839039392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIG3hoA","user":{"login":"wagnerfs","id":106078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs","html_url":"https://github.com/wagnerfs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T01:24:46Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T01:24:46Z","body":"@allenwp  I forgot to answer this, and yes, shift doesn't happen in Forward+, I've been noticing the differences since some of the people playing my game can't run vulkan.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4839039392/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]